  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed two-storey side extension, due to its siting, roof form design, and lack of set in from the common boundary at first floor, would create a visually incongruous addition that would fail to integrate with the character of the original dwelling or the immediate street scene, and would result in a terracing effect. The proposal is therefore contrary to Policy CP30 of the Enfield Core Strategy (2010), and Policies DMD13, DMD14, and DMD37 of the Enfield Development Management Document (2014)."
